<title>ARGENTINA: Italy's ENI interested in deal with YPF - agency.</title>
<headline>Italy's ENI interested in deal with YPF - agency.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The head of Italian oil firm ENI met with Argentine President Carlos Menem Tuesday and expressed his interest in a strategic alliance with Argentina's YPF, the state news agency Telam said.</p>
<p>Telam said Guglielmo Moscato wants &quot;a strategic alliance to be active in production and marketing of hydrocarbons in the Latin American market.&quot;</p>
<p>ENI is eager to sign a deal in the short term but the company executive said &quot;for now there are only conversations.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0618</p>
</text>
